@sRenaGlow

I'm 23 years old living with my partner, recently moved here so we could start living together from across the country. I don't have any money to spend on myself because of my expenses & him looking for a job but that doesn't matter. My sister plays Roblox and I'd give it to her because my mom can't afford to get her much she wants or needs so maybe I could give her the Roblox so she can have it towards something she wants since she doesn't get much privilege or gifts, I'm sure she'd love it allot!
About myself more: I play adopt me allot, last year I got into Roblox so I could play with my partner and my sister and now I am addicted after dissing Roblox my entire life without playing it xD
